<title>USA: Rockwell International Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Rockwell International Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>SEAL BEACH, Calif., Nov 6 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.45		    $0.88</p>
<p> Net		 97,000		   189,000</p>
<p> Revs		2,661,000		2,494,000</p>
<p>	   12  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $3.34		    $3.42</p>
<p> Net		 726,000		  742,000</p>
<p> Revs		10,373,000	     9,065,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note - Period ended September 30.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 net includes a special, one-time charge of $121 million or $0.56 a share for write-off of purchased research and development, a charge of $74 million or $0.34 a share for restructuring and a gain of $76 million or $0.35 a share. Q4 EPS from continuing operations before the special charge of $0.56 was $0.88 vs $0.53.</p>
</text>
